icense Git-derived code from GPL-2.0 to MIT","user":{"login":"hikarucorporation","id":293726121,"node_id":"U_kgDOEYHnqQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/293726121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation","html_url":"https://github.com/hikarucorporation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hikarucorporation/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-21T02:35:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:35:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi @feder-cr,\n\nI was taking a look at the repository and noticed that the `LICENSE` file is set to **MIT** (including copyright notices imported from GitLab Inc.).\n\nHowever, there is a fundamental legal and licensing constraint to consider regarding this project:\n\n1. **Git is Free/Libre Software (GPL-2.0):** Just like the Linux kernel, official Git is distributed under the **GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPL-2.0)**.\n2. **One-Way Copyleft Enforcement:** License compatibility only works in one direction (from permissive to copyleft). While you can incorporate MIT code into a GPL-2.0 project, **you cannot perform a rollback or re-license GPL-2.0 code to a permissive license like MIT** without the explicit consent of every single copyright holder of the original codebase (which is virtually impossible for projects like Git).\n\nEven major commercial AI coding tools and license compliance frameworks enforce this principle: GPL-2.0 code must remain GPL-2.0 upon distribution or modification.\n\nTo ensure proper open-source compliance and avoid legal ambiguity for contributors, I strongly recommend restoring the original **GPL-2.0** license text in the `LICENSE` file and cleaning up the header notices.\n\nThanks for building `git-ai`!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/feder-cr/git-ai/issues/5/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/feder-cr/git-ai/issues/5/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-10-21T02:35:59Z"},{"id":"17770830339","type":"WatchEvent","actor":{"id":66291,"login":"fireyy","display_login":"fireyy","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fireyy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66291?"},"repo":{"id":1420751050,"name":"feder-cr/git-ai","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/feder-cr/git-ai"},"payload":{"action":"started"},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-10-21T02:27:20Z"},{"id":"17770607161","type":"WatchEvent","actor":{"id":443464,"login":"siripuramrk","display_login":"siripuramrk","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/siripuramrk","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/443464?"},"repo":{"id":1420751050,"name":"feder-cr/git-ai","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/feder-cr/git-ai"},"payload":{"action":"started"},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-10-21T02:23:16Z"},{"id":"17770145573","type":"WatchE